1. Added `stretch: Boolean = false` to `LabeledValue` so `.weight(1f, fill = true)` applies only when stretch is requested, updated `LabeledValueRow` callers in `OverviewSections.kt` to pass `stretch = true` with `Modifier.weight(1f).fillMaxHeight()`, and updated `LabeledValueRow` KDoc.
2. Set `PatientDirectoryCard` patient name text `textAlign = TextAlign.Start` and removed `isArabic` / `TextAlign.End` conditional logic.
3. Updated `BloodPressureCell` severe blood pressure color to `if (isDarkTheme()) StatusHighDarkText else ActionRose` with required imports.
4. Converted status tags in `PatientDirectoryCard` to `FlowRow(horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(4.dp, Alignment.End), verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(4.dp), itemVerticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically)` while preserving 48dp touch target on the incomplete chip and all semantics test tags.
5. Added `post_term_badge` ("Post") string resource to [strings.xml](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml#L689) and referenced it in `PatientDirectoryMetricsRow.kt`.
6. Updated status border tokens in [Theme.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/Theme.kt#L166-L176) (`StatusIncompleteBorder` -> `#757E8E`, `StatusModerateBorder` -> `#9E6F1E`, `StatusIncompleteDarkBorder` -> `#7D889E`).
7. Removed hardcoded `.offset(x = 12.dp)` from `SectionTextAction` while preserving 48x48dp minimum touch target and aligned card action at the end edge across both LTR and RTL layouts via card layout padding.
8. Removed redundant comment restating the name Row parameters in [PatientDirectoryCard.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/patientdirectory/PatientDirectoryCard.kt#L80).
